+download failing its digest and the ad hoc app are discarded; stable 9.9.8
+is offered, or pre-release 9.9.9 with the beta option; a skipped version is
+left alone by automatic mode; installing 9.9.9 backs up the settings, swaps
+the bundle and reopens it (still on the e2e keychain) with a rollback to the
+old version on offer; rolling back restores the old app and, as the OBS
+major version differs, the scenes and settings from before the update, and
+skips 9.9.9.
